Cut FAST-LIO2's resident memory without changing its maths.
1. The three 100000-point scratch clouds (normvec, laserCloudOri, corr_normvect) were preallocated (14 MB) and h_share_model indexed laserCloudOri/corr_normvect
   after clear(), i.e. past size() (undefined behaviour that only worked because the capacity was there). Now they start empty and h_share_model resize()s
   them to feats_down_size, which is also the bound the code already assumed.
2. Drop pcl_io (PCD saving: the /map_save service, whose only data source is the map_en accumulation, and a dead block at exit). pcl_io is the only
   library that pulls VTK (~10 MB of file-backed pages) into the node. The service now answers success=false.
Base: hku-mars/FAST_LIO a4743b0 (ROS2 branch) with 0001-build-with-cxx17.patch applied.

